     tooltip="Pair Study table: do selected assets ka deep study - rolling windows (30/60/90...), lead-lag, speed aur performance. Section on/off niche ke toggles se. Scanner aur Pair table dono Top Right par hain, isliye ek time par ek hi ON rakhein ya position alag karein.")
