     tooltip="Scanner list ka order.\n• Abs Correlation: sabse closely related pehle.\n• Correlation high to low / low to high: signed value ke hisaab se.\n• Strengthening first: jinka relation abhi mazboot ho raha hai.\n• Weakening first: jinka relation toot raha hai.")

